    "local_derivation": [
      "Seed 71644 gives d3(w2^2)=beta^5*g.",
      "Naturality row 152091 gives d3(beta^2)=h1*w1*g=h0^2*alpha*e0, after sphere row 152090. This is a further derived fact, not a second BR21 seed.",
      "Leibniz yields d3(beta^2*w2^2)=beta^7*g+h0^2*alpha*e0*w2^2. The unique source basis in (22,148) is [0]; its target in (25,150) is [0,1].",
      "The possible incoming d2 source (23,149) has no E2 basis. Thus this staircase records B3 at (25,150) as span([0,1]); [1] is not in B3.",
      "The Hurewicz map sends sphere source (21,147)[0]=generator530 to zero, and both rejected targets [0,1] and [0,1,3] to tmf[1]. This forces the contradiction recorded in 154536 and 154537.",
      "If the BR21 contribution d3(w2^2) were zero while the other local equation remained, the product differential would hit [1]. The displayed local contradiction would then fail. This does not assert that every possible proof of Main must use BR21."
    ],
